{"sections":[{"slug":"Gromov--Witten不变量","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Gromov--Witten不变量"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Gromov–Witten <span lang=\"zh\">不变量</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Gromov–Witten 不变量”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一种来自量子物理的曲线计数</span> (curve counting) <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">物理图景</span></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">以下是</span> Artan Sheshmani <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> BIMSA <span lang=\"zh\">公开课的笔记</span>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">远大愿景</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">将量子力学与</span> Einstein <span lang=\"zh\">引力理论融合起来</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">建立一个严格的数学模型</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">弦论构造的宇宙是</span> $4$ <span lang=\"zh\">维时空上附着的</span> $6$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Calabi--丘流形","text":"Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">纤维丛</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">微观粒子向</span> $6$ <span lang=\"zh\">维的纤维方向的扩张</span> (extension) <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">维的曲线即</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">弦</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">不同粒子对应的弦的振动方式不同</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">我们需要研究弦的量子相互作用</span> (quantum interaction). "},{"Local":{"url":"/Feynmann图","text":"Feynmann <span lang=\"zh\">图</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">和</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Feynmann路径积分","text":"Feynmann <span lang=\"zh\">路径积分</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">描述了粒子的量子相互作用</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">而在弦论中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">弦的移动给出管状的</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">维曲面</span> (“<span lang=\"zh\">世界面</span>”), <span lang=\"zh\">其上有</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">度量</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">事实上是一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">此时的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Feynmann路径积分","text":"Feynmann <span lang=\"zh\">路径积分</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是在所有</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Calabi--丘流形","text":"Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann面","text":"Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上进行的</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">不幸的是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个积分不良定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为其中与路径的几何性质</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">引力</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">相关的一个测度会在有奇点的路径</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">面生出一个无穷长细圆柱</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">处爆炸</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">补救的方法是研究弦论的拓扑版本</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即允许路径的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">保持拓扑性质的</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">光滑化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">又称</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/重整化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">重整化</span>"}},{"Plain":" (renormalizing). <span lang=\"zh\">背景的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Calabi--丘流形","text":"Calabi–<span lang=\"zh\">丘流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的几何</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">复结构</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler结构","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">经历着不断的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">引力</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">形变</span> (deformations, fluctuations). <span lang=\"zh\">我们希望路径积分在形变之下不变</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这便是</span> <strong>Gromov–Witten <span lang=\"zh\">不变量</span></strong>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">稳定性</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">稳定性是指自同构群有限</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">事实</span>.</strong> <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为光滑复不可约射影曲线</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/亏格","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亏格</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $g$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $g=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $C\\simeq \\mathbb P^1$, $\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbb P^1)\\simeq PGL_2(\\mathbb{C})$, <span lang=\"zh\">自同构太多了</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们不喜欢</span>;</li>\n<li></li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}